Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3, python3-pil, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, xvfb, xauth
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: svent-login
Architecture: all
Depends: lxdm, python3, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xfonts-terminus
Description: SventOS login manager configuration (LXDM)
 Minimal LXDM configuration with a dark island background, a centered login
 entry and desktop, language and keyboard controls. Installed desktop sessions
 remain available through LXDM. Installing this package selects LXDM without
 restarting the running display manager.
